            "q_1": "Do I need a paid Notion plan?",
            "a_1": "<p>No. Every template works on Notion's free plan, on the web, the desktop app and the phone app.</p>",
            "q_2": "Can I change a template?",
            "a_2": "<p>Every page, property and view is yours to edit. Rename things, add columns, delete pages you do not need.</p>",
            "q_3": "What does the commercial licence cover?",
            "a_3": "<p>The personal licence is for your own use. The commercial licence lets you use the template inside your business or set it up for one client. Reselling it is not allowed with either.</p>",
